		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.submit-btn-disabled {
		background-color: #E5E7EB;
	}

	.submit-btn-text{
		font-size: 16px;
		color: #FFFFFF;
		font-weight: 800;
	}
</style>
